Description: deb: support systemd unit dir changes (backport of 19cef190694d)
 Current systemd (Debian trixie and later) installs units to
 /usr/lib/systemd/system, but the debian/*.install files before squid 19.2.4
 only look in lib/systemd/system, so dh_install fails with missing files.
 Backport of upstream commit 19cef190694d15fda5404df2641e2d9ea92112eb
 ("deb: use variable expansion to support systemd unit dir changes"), which
 matches both locations with {usr/,}lib/systemd/system.
 This part covers ceph-exporter.install, which exists since 19.2.3.
Ceph-Version: >= 19.2.3, < 19.2.4
---
--- a/debian/ceph-exporter.install
+++ b/debian/ceph-exporter.install
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
-lib/systemd/system/ceph-exporter*
+{usr/,}lib/systemd/system/ceph-exporter*
 usr/bin/ceph-exporter
